			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"派蒙"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 120220101,
					"content": "咦，心海還沒來嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220102,
					"content": "好奇怪啊，總感覺心海不像是那種會遲到的人…我們再多等一下吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220103,
					"content": "心海怎麼還沒來，會不會是遇到什麼麻煩了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220104,
					"content": "我們去找那邊的士兵打聽一下吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220701,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}要見珊瑚宮大人？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柴田"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220702,
					"content": "不好意思，珊瑚宮大人不在這裡，我也不知道她去了哪。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柴田"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220703,
					"content": "怎麼這樣…那我們只能回去了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220704,
					"content": "倒也不是。我記得珊瑚宮大人留下來的常備錦囊中，好像有應對這種情況的解決辦法。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柴田"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220705,
					"content": "讓我想想。第九十八條…<color=#00E1FFFF>「有客遠來，尋我不見；可來南邊，紫葉樹前」</color>。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柴田"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220706,
					"content": "備註上還寫了，只有珊瑚宮大人沒有留下任何其他交代，且客人身分很特別時，才能適用這一條。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柴田"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220707,
					"content": "兩位應該算遠道而來的客人吧。這錦囊我一直帶著，應該不會有錯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柴田"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220708,
					"content": "心海果然什麼情況都考慮到了，那我們到她說的地方找找看吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1202202,
			"completionStepIds": [
				1202208
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"1202208",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 1202208,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"珊瑚宮心海"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 120220204,
					"content": "心海！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220205,
					"content": "原來妳在這裡呀！不是說好今天一起去籌備慶功晚會嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220206,
					"content": "#喔…是{F#妳}{M#你}們啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220207,
					"content": "抱歉，今天…有點不在狀態。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220208,
					"content": "是生病了嗎？我們馬上去找醫生…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220209,
					"content": "不是啦，只是我的「能量」暫時用完了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220210,
					"content": "能量…難，難道說心海，其實不是人類嗎！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220211,
					"content": "不，只是一種比喻而已啦。雖然有些慚愧，但我沒辦法一直維持那種無所不能的樣子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220212,
						120220213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220212,
					"content": "昨天被搭話的時候…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220214
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120220214,
					"content": "#啊，{F#妳}{M#你}注意到了嗎？看來我遮掩的功夫還不到家，還得繼續鍛煉才行…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220215,
					"content": "其實，我並不是很擅長做一個上位者。最早的時候，我的夢想就是讀讀兵書，做個幕僚之類的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220216,
					"content": "跟別人說話、照顧別人的情緒、察言觀色、分配利益…在我看來是很麻煩的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220217,
					"content": "要讓別人如沐春風，又要讓他們有所敬畏，這不是我擅長的領域。或是說，這是我曾經不想涉足的領域。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220218,
					"content": "但是因為血脈的原因，「現人神巫女」的位置終究會傳到我的手裡。喜歡也好，不喜歡也罷，這是沒辦法的事情。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220219,
					"content": "所以，當我感覺自己要撐不住了的時候，我就會到這裡來。看看書，休息一會…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220220,
					"content": "不用擔心，並不會影響工作。籌備慶功會的事情，我已經安排給其他人了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220221,
					"content": "今晚還有一場演講，不能讓士兵們看出有什麼端倪…好不容易爭取到了和平，我希望他們可以更加輕鬆自在一些。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220222,
					"content": "有什麼我們能幫忙的嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220223,
					"content": "其實放著不管，我的能量也會慢慢恢復。但如果能聽到我感興趣的兵書，或許能更快地振作起來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220224,
					"content": "我記得上次有一本書看了一半，不知道放哪了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220225,
					"content": "就讓我們來找一找吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220226,
					"content": "然後讀給心海聽，這樣心海就能振作起來了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220227,
					"content": "#真的嗎？謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}們啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220228,
					"content": "#呵呵…果然，{F#妳}{M#你}們回海祇島真的太好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宮心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220213,
					"content": "確實感覺心海很苦惱。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220214
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1202203,
			"completionStepIds": [
				1202217
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"1202217",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 1202217,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"派蒙"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 120220301,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}{F#妳}{M#你}看，這個會不會就是心海在找的兵書呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220302,
					"content": "今天劍魚二番隊的隊長回來了，能量值加四——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220303
